 "description": "Free. Pre-trade rug check for one new memecoin: a pump.fun mint (a mint or a pump.fun/gmgn/solscan/birdeye link) or a Robinhood Chain pons curve or token address (0x + 40 hex). Returns verdict (avoid | caution | no_flags_observed by the fixed public rule, the same word the paid verdict and rhc_curve_card give; null when the token is not covered), reason {code, text} (the first rule that fired), coverage (full | thin | not_covered, with coverage_reason), age_s and next: the paid detail (verdict $0.01 and mint_risk_card $0.025 for pump.fun, rhc_curve_card $0.02 for pons) and the free record page. No odds, holder shares or market figures; no_flags_observed is not a safety verdict. 30 calls per hour per client. Use it first on any token you are about to buy, then pay for the evidence when the word matters.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
